- [AI Safeguards](https://www.egnyte.com/products/ai-safeguards): Visibility and control over how employees use AI tools (including ChatGPT, Copilot, and others) â€” detecting shadow AI usage, enforcing data-sharing policies, and generating audit logs for compliance teams.

- [PDF Annotation](https://www.egnyte.com/products/pdf-editor): View, edit, and manipulate PDF files natively in Egnyte to seamlessly apply annotations, compare document versions, fill out forms, and handle e-signatures in Egnyte's secure cloud environment.

- [E-Signature](https://www.egnyte.com/products/e-signature): Integrated e-signature capability for sending, tracking, and storing signed documents within Egnyte's governed content environment.

- [Document Portal](https://www.egnyte.com/products/document-portal): Secure, custom-branded portals to streamline external document collection and sharing with automated upload requests, integrated task reminders, and built-in review.

- [Project Hub](https://www.egnyte.com/products/project-hub): Centralized project workspace connecting content, tasks, and collaborators in a single governed environment, designed for project-intensive industries like AEC and media.

