## Compliance Solutions

- [CMMC / NIST SP 800-171](https://www.egnyte.com/products/cmmc-compliance): Egnyte helps defense contractors achieve and maintain CMMC Level 2 compliance by securing CUI, enforcing access controls, and generating the documentation required for certification.

- [GxP Compliance](https://www.egnyte.com/products/gxp-compliance): Validated content platform for life sciences organizations operating under FDA GxP guidelines, with electronic records, audit trails, and controlled document workflows meeting 21 CFR Part 11 requirements.

- [Building Safety Act (Golden Thread)](https://www.egnyte.com/products/building-safety-act-compliance): Egnyte supports UK Building Safety Act compliance by maintaining a structured, auditable record of building safety information â€” the "Golden Thread" â€” across the design, construction, and operational lifecycle.

- [ISO 27001](https://www.egnyte.com/products/iso-27001-compliance): Content governance capabilities mapped to ISO 27001 controls for organizations pursuing or maintaining information security management certification.

- [GDPR and CCPA](https://www.egnyte.com/products/gdpr-ccpa-compliance): Sensitive data discovery, classification, and access governance tools that support GDPR and CCPA compliance programs, including data subject access request (DSAR) workflows.

