- [Insider Risk Management](https://www.egnyte.com/solutions/insider-risk-management): Mitigate internal data threats from accidental or malicious user actions using machine learning to baseline normal file behavior, flag suspicious login locations, and automatically restrict the sharing of high-value company content.

- [Ransomware Detection](https://www.egnyte.com/products/ransomware-detection): Real-time ransomware detection utilizing signature-based scans and behavioral analytics to catch zero-day threats, automatically cutting off compromised access and accelerating point-in-time file recovery.

- [Content Lifecycle Management](https://www.egnyte.com/products/content-lifecycle-management): Policy-driven automation for archiving, deleting, and managing content across its full lifecycle â€” reducing storage costs and compliance exposure from stale or redundant files.

- [Sensitive Content Protection](https://www.egnyte.com/solutions/sensitive-content-protection): Automated discovery and classification of sensitive data (PII, PHI, financial records, IP) across all content in Egnyte, with risk scoring and remediation workflows.

